WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:01.968 --> 00:00:16.516 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(tic tac)

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:16.516 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ ♪

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.516 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Juin 1972 à Stockholm.

00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:27.227 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La capitale suédoise accueille

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:30.897 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des milliers de délégués et plus

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:32.098 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'une centaine de dirigeants

00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:33.333 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du monde.

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:35.702 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Certains arrivent en voiture.

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:35.702 size:53% position:73% line:53%
D'autres ont la possibilité

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:35.702 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de circuler à vélo.

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:43.410 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Un moyen de transport à propos

00:00:41.274 --> 00:00:44.911 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour la toute première

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:44.911 size:53% position:73% line:53%
conférence sur l'environnement

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:44.911 size:53% position:73% line:53%
humain.

00:00:49.783 --> 00:00:52.752 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est le début d'une conscience

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:53.787 size:53% position:73% line:53%
écologique collective.

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:54.821 size:53% position:73% line:53%
S'en suivra une éclosion de

00:00:52.852 --> 00:00:56.022 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ministères de l'Environnement

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:57.257 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dans de nombreux pays,

00:00:54.921 --> 00:01:00.060 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et la naissance du programme

00:00:56.122 --> 00:01:01.294 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des Nations unies pour

00:00:57.357 --> 00:01:02.495 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'environnement.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:03.730 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le secrétaire général du sommet,

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:06.266 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le Canadien Maurice Strong,

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:06.266 size:53% position:73% line:53%
conclut que l'humanité vient

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:06.266 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de collectivement dégriser.

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:18.178 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La première ministre de l'Inde,

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:20.947 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Indira Gandhi, rappellera que

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:20.947 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ces choix difficiles concernent

00:01:18.278 --> 00:01:20.947 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tout un chacun.

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:33.626 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Un rendez-vous est alors fixé

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:34.861 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tous les 10 ans pour prendre

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:36.062 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le pouls de la planète.

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:40.700 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Tenue en 1982, en pleine guerre

00:01:34.961 --> 00:01:41.934 size:53% position:73% line:53%
froide, la conférence de Nairobi

00:01:36.162 --> 00:01:43.169 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tourne rapidement dans l'oubli.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:44.371 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais 10 ans plus tard, la

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:45.638 size:53% position:73% line:53%
conférence de Rio de Janeiro,

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:46.873 size:53% position:73% line:53%
rebaptisée Sommet de la Terre,

00:01:44.471 --> 00:01:48.108 size:53% position:73% line:53%
marque un moment charnière.

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:54.147 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et la société civile y attend

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:55.648 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de pied ferme les dirigeants

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:57.150 size:53% position:73% line:53%
du monde.

00:01:54.247 --> 00:01:58.385 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Même des enfants, comme Severn

00:01:55.749 --> 00:02:00.453 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Cullis-Suzuki, la fille de

00:01:57.250 --> 00:02:00.453 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'écologiste David Suzuki,

00:01:58.485 --> 00:02:00.453 size:53% position:73% line:53%
veulent se faire entendre.

00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:08.962 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Les délégués accouchent

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:10.196 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'importantes conventions

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:11.431 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sur l'environnement.

00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:12.665 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et c'est à ce moment que prend

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:13.867 size:53% position:73% line:53%
forme la Conférence des parties

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:15.101 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sur les changements

00:02:12.766 --> 00:02:16.102 size:53% position:73% line:53%
climatiques - les COP.

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:17.904 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le concept du développement

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:17.904 size:53% position:73% line:53%
durable, lui, devient

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:17.904 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un nouveau crédo.

00:02:21.374 --> 00:02:24.310 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le sommet de 2002 à Johannesburg

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:25.345 size:53% position:73% line:53%
se tient un an après

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:26.379 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les attentats du 11 septembre.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:27.380 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La sécurité semble être la seule

00:02:25.445 --> 00:02:28.615 size:53% position:73% line:53%
priorité.

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:29.849 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et l'absence de George W. Bush

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:31.084 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mine les négociations.

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:32.619 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Le président français, Jacques

00:02:29.949 --> 00:02:34.120 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Chirac, marquera toutefois

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:36.156 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les esprits avec son discours.

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:38.191 size:53% position:73% line:53%
JACQUES CHIRAC, président de

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:43.596 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la France

00:02:36.256 --> 00:02:43.596 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Notre maison brûle et nous

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:43.596 size:53% position:73% line:53%
regardons ailleurs.

00:02:46.132 --> 00:02:50.003 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le sommet suivant, à Rio,

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:52.906 size:53% position:73% line:53%
se déroule sur fond de crise

00:02:48.902 --> 00:02:54.140 size:53% position:73% line:53%
financière. Ses accomplissements

00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:55.341 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sont timides.

00:02:53.006 --> 00:02:56.576 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 50 ans plus tard, les délégués

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:57.810 size:53% position:73% line:53%
se retrouveront ici à Stockholm

00:02:55.442 --> 00:02:59.045 size:53% position:73% line:53%
où tout à commencé. On discutera

00:02:56.676 --> 00:03:00.280 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de ce que le secrétaire général

00:02:57.911 --> 00:03:01.514 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de l'ONU appelle la triple

00:02:59.145 --> 00:03:02.715 size:53% position:73% line:53%
crise planétaire, celle des

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:03.950 size:53% position:73% line:53%
changements climatiques, de la

00:03:01.614 --> 00:03:05.485 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dégradation de la biodiversité

00:03:02.815 --> 00:03:07.020 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et de la pollution.

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:08.521 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais en vérité, les attentes

00:03:05.585 --> 00:03:10.056 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sont modestes, parce que

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:11.591 size:53% position:73% line:53%
maintenant, les grandes

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:12.825 size:53% position:73% line:53%
décisions se prennent dans

00:03:10.156 --> 00:03:14.060 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'autres grands rendez-vous

00:03:11.691 --> 00:03:15.261 size:53% position:73% line:53%
comme les COP.

00:03:12.926 --> 00:03:16.496 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais ce sommet reste l'occasion

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:17.497 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour la société civile

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:17.730 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de se faire entendre.

00:03:16.596 --> 00:03:17.730 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Ici Elisa Serret,

00:03:17.597 --> 00:03:17.730 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Radio-Can

